                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4790fc4a-c917-3997-a63a-ee521c475a1f",
                        "entry_id": "78b35292-5ba8-34db-b944-38c305fad1e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "fields or properties belonging to the same owner that are scattered and spread out instead of continuous"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9cc83ce5-0c97-3405-aaee-7441eedca4ff",
                        "entry_id": "78b35292-5ba8-34db-b944-38c305fad1e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "mixed-use neighborhood (a built-up area of mixed residential and commercial use, especially in the context of e.g. noise control ordinance)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "uncommon"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "77479aef-0d0b-3caa-a0e1-850d6671e1d6",
                        "entry_id": "78b35292-5ba8-34db-b944-38c305fad1e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "murky situation, snarl, mess (an unclear situation characterized by multiple conflicting or compounding needs, motivations or developments)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "figuratively",
                            "formal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0a8c38b-6cd3-4bfd-b92c-51ba1c21e7a1",
                                "sense_id": "77479aef-0d0b-3caa-a0e1-850d6671e1d6",
                                "text": "Angesichts dieser Gemengelage von sich widersprechenden pädagogischen, infektiologischen, architektonischen (kleine Klassenräume, olle Toiletten), gesundheitlichen (angeblich gehört ein Drittel der Lehrer zur Risikogruppe), sozialen (Schüler ohne Computer) Argumenten einen genauen Fahrplan für die stufenweise Rückkehr zur Unterrichtsnormalität zu formulieren, ist eine Herausforderung, an der die Kultusminister nur scheitern konnten.",
                                "translation": "In light of this mess of contradictory pedagogical, infectiological, architectural (small classrooms, shabby toilets), medical (one third of teachers supposedly at high risk), social (students without computer access) arguments, developing a specific timeline for a gradual return to regular teaching is a challenge that the ministers of education had no hope of succeeding at.",
                                "english": "In light of this mess of contradictory pedagogical, infectiological, architectural (small classrooms, shabby toilets), medical (one third of teachers supposedly at high risk), social (students without computer access) arguments, developing a specific timeline for a gradual return to regular teaching is a challenge that the ministers of education had no hope of succeeding at."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
